{"id":"vod_hh_130525","vodId":"130525","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"东京猫猫（中文版）","name_cn":"东京猫猫（中文版）","date":"2002-01-01","year":"2002","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第50集已完结","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/38e992c1653faa1186dfd8998a86177d.jpg"},"summary":"地球，无比美丽的蔚蓝色星球上生存着100多万种生命。但是现在2500种动物和它们的生活环境正遭受着新的威胁。我们要拯救所有动物和自己身为人类的命运…… 一个混乱的早晨，美少女桃宫草莓和全校女生都爱慕着的NO.1青山雅也在Red-Date动物展约会时，一只可爱的西表山猫溶进了草莓的心脏像血液一样循环到了四肢百骸。当她惊叫出声时，才发觉自己在约会时睡着了，也许并不是梦，因为草莓变的非常奇怪，从５层楼高的护栏摔下时，居然可以稳当着陆；会像猫一样叼住碗里的鱼；和朋友说话时不停发出“Mew-Mew”的叫声。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-04-09 16:18:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":50,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/elY5Goja/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/b4xRXjJb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dyPrY4Rb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/epYQMAVa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aKrZ4xGe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/erkRO42a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/en5rKq5d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/elY5G3Ma/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dwpmWDre/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/b4xRXOxb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/b68RZwNe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aADP4Eje/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dwpmW18e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aKrZ4o8e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/ejRqDrve/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/epYQMDya/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dwpmWzXe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集